=f(x)$ is a solution of the differential equation” is true. Since statement “Substituting $y=f(x)$ and ${y}^{′}={f}^{′}(x)$ into the differential equation gives a true statement” is true, the function $y=-3{x}^{4}$ is a solution to our differential equation.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is “Substituting $y=f(x)$ and ${y}^{′}={f}^{′}(x)$ into the differential equation gives a true statement”; “The function $y=f(x)$ is a solution of the differential equation” only."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186494086 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "192c604d-bfad-57a9-aafa-28af0b84c8fd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494085} {:answer/id #uuid "e3015e48-583f-5d26-b429-b782d116b88a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494119}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "192c604d-bfad-57a9-aafa-28af0b84c8fd" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494085} :answer-field/id #uuid "22e46930-92a0-561f-be02-0e67f2899630" :answer-field/key "Substituting $y=f(x)$ and ${y}^{′}={f}^{′}(x)$ into the differential equation gives a true statement" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494087} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a6fff5d8-3756-555b-87b0-8b2c81ddc8ee" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494106} {:answer/id #uuid "d7d998fe-c81d-521a-aa9f-1f3774a325b4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494112}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a6fff5d8-3756-555b-87b0-8b2c81ddc8ee" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "