y}^{′}=\\frac{3y}{x},\\,x\\ne 0\n$$\n\nLet $f(x)=-3{x}^{3}.$ Which of the following statements are true?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "For a function $f(x)$ to be a solution to a differential equation, it must satisfy the equation for all values of $x$ in an interval where the function is defined and the equation is valid.\n\nWith that in mind, let's check each statement in turn.\n\n- Statement ${f}^{′}(x)=-6{x}^{2}$ is false. Differentiating $f(x)=-3{x}^{3},$ we get \n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{f}^{′}(x) & ={(-3{x}^{3})}^{′} \\\\  & =-3\\cdot 3{x}^{2} \\\\  & =-9{x}^{2} \\\\  & \\ne -6{x}^{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement “Substituting $y=f(x)$ and ${y}^{′}={f}^{′}(x)$ into the differential equation gives a true statement” is true. Substituting $y=-3{x}^{3}$ and ${y}^{′}=-9{x}^{2}$ into the original equation, we get a true statement:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{y}^{′} & \\overset{?}{=}\\frac{3y}{x} \\\\ -9{x}^{2} & \\overset{?}{=}\\frac{3(-3{x}^{3})}{x} \\\\ -9{x}^{2} & =-9{x}^{2}\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\n- Statement “The function $y=f(x)$ is a solution of the differential equation” is true. Since statement “Substituting $y=f(x)$ and ${y}^{′}={f}^{′}(x)$ into the differential equation gives a true statement” is true, the function $y=-3{x}^{3}$ is a solution to our differential equation.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is “Substituting $y=f(x)$ and ${y}^{′}={f}^{′}(x)$ into the differential equation gives a true statement”; “The function $y=f(x)$ is a solution of the differential equation” only."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186494136 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "043bd6b5-f398-59fb-9664-c843c3927785" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494128} {:answer/id #uuid "fed93e13-4643-5fa5-adb6-1d03e9aecd03" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494224}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fed93e13-4643-5fa5-adb6-1d03e9aecd03" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494224} :answer-field/id #uuid "185aa277-ec0b-5b7f-9dfd-7fd410156dfc" :answer-field/key "$y=2 x^{4} - x$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494135} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "119b6234-2b31-5432-915d-1e7dc0ef6b47" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494133} {:answer/id #uuid "1cf34b6d-fb8d-5cff-9900-0f2e7b496e9b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494138}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1cf34b6d-fb8d-5cff-9900-0f2e7b496e9b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494138} :answer-field/id #uuid "1dff065e-2b3b-5c1e-a226-f81d326f6baf" :answer-field/key "$y=- x^{4} - 2 x - 1$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494140} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "63afce1e-e0ab-5d34-81d4-696e5637c1d7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494168} {:answer/id #uuid "bf8f849b-f988-5a2f-8dc4-21d836414a4f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494201}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "63afce1e-e0ab-5d34-81d4-696e5637c1d7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494168} :answer-field/id #uuid "7f318fe0-a53e-51ad-b079-e7ecb29bbd16" :answer-field/key "$y=- 3 x^{4} - 2 x + 1$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494176}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "186f19a6-4a5f-585e-b13e-b8bce737384f" :question/problem "Consider the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=6 + \\frac{4 y}{x},\\,x\\ne 0.\n$$\n\n Which of the following is a solution to this equation?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "For a function $f(x)$ to be a solution to a differential equation, it must satisfy the equation for all values of $x$ in the stated domain.\n\nWe check each proposed solution by differentiating and substituting it into the original equation. \n\n- Differentiating $y=- x^{4} - 2 x - 1,$ we get $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=- 4 x^{3} - 2.$ Substituting into the original equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =6 + \\frac{4 y}{x} \\\\ - 4 x^{3} - 2 & \\overset{?}{=}\\frac{4\\cdot \\left(- x^{4} - 2 x - 1\\right)}{x}+6 \\\\ - 4 x^{3} - 2 & \\overset{?}{=}- 4 x^{3} - 2 - \\frac{4}{x} \\\\ \\frac{4}{x} & \\not\\equiv 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis statement is *not true* for all $x.$ Therefore, the function $y=- x^{4} - 2 x - 1$ is *not* a solution to our differential equation.\n\n- Differentiating $y=- 3 x^{4} - 2 x + 1,$ we get $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=- 12 x^{3} - 2.$ Substituting into the original equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =6 + \\frac{4 y}{x} \\\\ - 12 x^{3} - 2 & \\overset{?}{=}\\frac{4\\cdot \\left(- 3 x^{4} - 2 x + 1\\right)}{x}+6 \\\\ - 12 x^{3} - 2 & \\overset{?}{=}- 12 x^{3} - 2 + \\frac{4}{x} \\\\ - \\frac{4}{x} & \\not\\equiv 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis statement is *not true* for all $x.$ Therefore, the function $y=- 3 x^{4} - 2 x + 1$ is *not* a solution to our differential equation.\n\n- Differentiating $y=2 x^{4} - x,$ we get $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=8 x^{3} - 1.$ Substituting into the original equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =6 + \\frac{4 y}{x} \\\\ 8 x^{3} - 1 & \\overset{?}{=}\\frac{4\\cdot \\left(2 x^{4} - x\\right)}{x}+6 \\\\ 8 x^{3} - 1 & \\overset{?}{=}8 x^{3} + 2 \\\\ -3 & \\not\\equiv 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis statement is *not true* for all $x.$ Therefore, the function $y=2 x^{4} - x$ is *not* a solution to our differential equation.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"None.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186494155 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5779ad75-a9e3-519a-83ec-38ffe7d63e18" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494164} {:answer/id #uuid "e4c27302-eb79-5e34-ab06-6e23f1c7b0ef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494216}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e4c27302-eb79-5e34-ab06-6e23f1c7b0ef" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494216} :answer-field/id #uuid "c46a625b-90ba-578a-b81e-66724eae64ba" :answer-field/key "$y=- e^{x}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494203} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4a88c68b-2230-5b15-a29b-58b0cdaf4b98" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494160} {:answer/id #uuid "beaf076d-0d2e-5e77-94ac-b9ea1cb7b58b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494200}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "beaf076d-0d2e-5e77-94ac-b9ea1cb7b58b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494200} :answer-field/id #uuid "ccfd7c37-8011-5662-abf6-925422db5d7c" :answer-field/key "$y=- e^{- x}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494206} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "64aca6ee-096a-51b1-b276-74fc2847b0e5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494169} {:answer/id #uuid "7c3ece63-d679-5ff6-a15d-e19e115bad5c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494173}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "7c3ece63-d679-5ff6-a15d-e19e115bad5c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494173} :answer-field/id #uuid "d7b4cfc2-eb9e-534f-acb8-2d15173fb353" :answer-field/key "$y=e^{x} - 1$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494210}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "445c16a9-31b8-52c6-9989-0214ce5be143" :question/problem "Consider the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=y.\n$$\n\n Which of the following is a solution to this equation?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "For a function $f(x)$ to be a solution to a differential equation, it must satisfy the equation for all values of $x$ in the stated domain.\n\nWe check each proposed solution by differentiating and substituting it into the original equation. \n\n- Differentiating $y=e^{x} - 1,$ we get $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=e^{x}.$ Substituting into the original equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =y \\\\ e^{x} & \\overset{?}{=}1\\cdot \\left(e^{x} - 1\\right) \\\\ e^{x} & \\overset{?}{=}e^{x} - 1 \\\\ 1 & \\not\\equiv 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis statement is *not true* for all $x.$ Therefore, the function $y=e^{x} - 1$ is *not* a solution to our differential equation.\n\n- Differentiating $y=- e^{x},$ we get $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=- e^{x}.$ Substituting into the original equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =y \\\\ - e^{x} & \\overset{?}{=}1\\cdot \\left(- e^{x}\\right) \\\\ - e^{x} & =- e^{x}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis statement is *true*. Therefore, the function $y=- e^{x}$ *is* a solution to our differential equation.\n\n- Differentiating $y=- e^{- x},$ we get $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=e^{- x}.$ Substituting into the original equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =y \\\\ e^{- x} & \\overset{?}{=}1\\cdot \\left(- e^{- x}\\right) \\\\ e^{- x} & \\overset{?}{=}- e^{- x} \\\\ 2 e^{- x} & \\not\\equiv 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis statement is *not true* for all $x.$ Therefore, the function $y=- e^{- x}$ is *not* a solution to our differential equation.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $y=- e^{x}$ only."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186494158 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "054d7925-1847-562b-ae23-d79faab9f29c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494129} {:answer/id #uuid "f09cf4be-e51e-5251-bd38-9ee9d165772c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494219}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "054d7925-1847-562b-ae23-d79faab9f29c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494129} :answer-field/id #uuid "02340bc0-0e35-511b-8bdf-634b3b1617f2" :answer-field/key "$y=3 e^{x}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494125} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "8541587a-6f0d-5e4c-8ba8-dffa29013166" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494178} {:answer/id #uuid "a4ed4684-cdcb-588c-a840-886c4cff8762" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494189}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a4ed4684-cdcb-588c-a840-886c4cff8762" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494189} :answer-field/id #uuid "4066b5b3-5f66-5bb3-98fb-812b6147d21a" :answer-field/key "$y=-2 + 3 e^{- x}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494153} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "49e7daa0-d022-513e-8651-4ce1f2aae5a6" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494159} {:answer/id #uuid "60ac3f8d-bd55-5484-966f-7ce2dde8f33c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494166}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "60ac3f8d-bd55-5484-966f-7ce2dde8f33c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494166} :answer-field/id #uuid "42fde4a2-8a28-5a07-8c04-aafb5c22896f" :answer-field/key "$y=3 e^{x} - 2$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494154}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "482041dd-1ea5-59f6-ae3d-2788e211524d" :question/problem "Consider the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=- y.\n$$\n\n Which of the following is a solution to this equation?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "For a function $f(x)$ to be a solution to a differential equation, it must satisfy the equation for all values of $x$ in the stated domain.\n\nWe check each proposed solution by differentiating and substituting it into the original equation. \n\n- Differentiating $y=3 e^{x} - 2,$ we get $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=3 e^{x}.$ Substituting into the original equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =- y \\\\ 3 e^{x} & \\overset{?}{=}-1\\cdot \\left(3 e^{x} - 2\\right) \\\\ 3 e^{x} & \\overset{?}{=}2 - 3 e^{x} \\\\ 6 e^{x} - 2 & \\not\\equiv 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis statement is *not true* for all $x.$ Therefore, the function $y=3 e^{x} - 2$ is *not* a solution to our differential equation.\n\n- Differentiating $y=-2 + 3 e^{- x},$ we get $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=- 3 e^{- x}.$ Substituting into the original equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =- y \\\\ - 3 e^{- x} & \\overset{?}{=}-1\\cdot \\left(-2 + 3 e^{- x}\\right) \\\\ - 3 e^{- x} & \\overset{?}{=}2 - 3 e^{- x} \\\\ -2 & \\not\\equiv 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis statement is *not true* for all $x.$ Therefore, the function $y=-2 + 3 e^{- x}$ is *not* a solution to our differential equation.\n\n- Differentiating $y=3 e^{x},$ we get $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=3 e^{x}.$ Substituting into the original equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =- y \\\\ 3 e^{x} & \\overset{?}{=}-1\\cdot \\left(3 e^{x}\\right) \\\\ 3 e^{x} & \\overset{?}{=}- 3 e^{x} \\\\ 6 e^{x} & \\not\\equiv 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis statement is *not true* for all $x.$ Therefore, the function $y=3 e^{x}$ is *not* a solution to our differential equation.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is \"None.\""}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186494172 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0c479766-f0ed-598c-88bb-cd9e4aca3186" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494131} {:answer/id #uuid "24634106-6b6d-53e3-8be4-e55502551d40" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494141}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "24634106-6b6d-53e3-8be4-e55502551d40" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494141} :answer-field/id #uuid "043748fe-9f8c-5795-a26b-5e9bffd6a289" :answer-field/key "$y=e^{- x}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494127} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "02bc6886-cd38-59b8-accd-e14e1de740aa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494126} {:answer/id #uuid "b37f87cf-f5db-55e3-8ba9-32d8700d9e21" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494194}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "02bc6886-cd38-59b8-accd-e14e1de740aa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494126} :answer-field/id #uuid "963e2bab-fb7a-5aa3-aa24-bac5aef7a3d5" :answer-field/key "$y=e^{x} + 1$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494185} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "473054af-72eb-5f9d-8413-69674dad30c2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494157} {:answer/id #uuid "890ac81e-3d06-5feb-9f77-114c33f9cb4c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494181}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "473054af-72eb-5f9d-8413-69674dad30c2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494157} :answer-field/id #uuid "ae8b77b5-7e47-5062-bd24-e3807ebcecfa" :answer-field/key "$y=2 - 2 e^{x}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494192}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "7af2ca83-a7d1-5afb-b854-4b08878292b3" :question/problem "Consider the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=- y.\n$$\n\n Which of the following is a solution to this equation?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "For a function $f(x)$ to be a solution to a differential equation, it must satisfy the equation for all values of $x$ in the stated domain.\n\nWe check each proposed solution by differentiating and substituting it into the original equation. \n\n- Differentiating $y=2 - 2 e^{x},$ we get $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=- 2 e^{x}.$ Substituting into the original equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =- y \\\\ - 2 e^{x} & \\overset{?}{=}-1\\cdot \\left(2 - 2 e^{x}\\right) \\\\ - 2 e^{x} & \\overset{?}{=}2 e^{x} - 2 \\\\ 2 - 4 e^{x} & \\not\\equiv 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis statement is *not true* for all $x.$ Therefore, the function $y=2 - 2 e^{x}$ is *not* a solution to our differential equation.\n\n- Differentiating $y=e^{x} + 1,$ we get $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=e^{x}.$ Substituting into the original equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =- y \\\\ e^{x} & \\overset{?}{=}-1\\cdot \\left(e^{x} + 1\\right) \\\\ e^{x} & \\overset{?}{=}- e^{x} - 1 \\\\ 2 e^{x} + 1 & \\not\\equiv 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis statement is *not true* for all $x.$ Therefore, the function $y=e^{x} + 1$ is *not* a solution to our differential equation.\n\n- Differentiating $y=e^{- x},$ we get $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=- e^{- x}.$ Substituting into the original equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =- y \\\\ - e^{- x} & \\overset{?}{=}-1\\cdot \\left(e^{- x}\\right) \\\\ - e^{- x} & =- e^{- x}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis statement is *true*. Therefore, the function $y=e^{- x}$ *is* a solution to our differential equation.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $y=e^{- x}$ only."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186494183 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "17eda594-9fa2-5642-b504-32094afb3531" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494134} {:answer/id #uuid "3d059827-5211-57be-a9b6-d235d360e6b1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494151}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "17eda594-9fa2-5642-b504-32094afb3531" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494134} :answer-field/id #uuid "39f0802d-a09a-51b6-92f0-39b6aea6f833" :answer-field/key "$y=2 e^{- x}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494150} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "721f2a1c-4389-5465-8089-93e02f836757" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494171} {:answer/id #uuid "94df3465-3203-590f-9c4e-010abf29de1d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494184}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "721f2a1c-4389-5465-8089-93e02f836757" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494171} :answer-field/id #uuid "a17e5513-7787-5584-a800-ceb8da28798b" :answer-field/key "$y=- 3 e^{- x}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494187} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "b8d10f76-307c-51d4-9770-a45f901a8f73" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494197} {:answer/id #uuid "fb124e81-c8cd-5031-bf70-fde92df49f44" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494222}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "fb124e81-c8cd-5031-bf70-fde92df49f44" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494222} :answer-field/id #uuid "b5c30af1-43f6-5328-ad5b-fcc88c1b7c45" :answer-field/key "$y=-2 - e^{- x}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494195}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485} :question/id #uuid "9090ebe8-9264-5307-a4ba-1cdbb63b8aca" :question/problem "Consider the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=- y.\n$$\n\n Which of the following is a solution to this equation?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "For a function $f(x)$ to be a solution to a differential equation, it must satisfy the equation for all values of $x$ in the stated domain.\n\nWe check each proposed solution by differentiating and substituting it into the original equation. \n\n- Differentiating $y=-2 - e^{- x},$ we get $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=e^{- x}.$ Substituting into the original equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =- y \\\\ e^{- x} & \\overset{?}{=}-1\\cdot \\left(-2 - e^{- x}\\right) \\\\ e^{- x} & \\overset{?}{=}2 + e^{- x} \\\\ -2 & \\not\\equiv 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis statement is *not true* for all $x.$ Therefore, the function $y=-2 - e^{- x}$ is *not* a solution to our differential equation.\n\n- Differentiating $y=- 3 e^{- x},$ we get $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=3 e^{- x}.$ Substituting into the original equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =- y \\\\ 3 e^{- x} & \\overset{?}{=}-1\\cdot \\left(- 3 e^{- x}\\right) \\\\ 3 e^{- x} & =3 e^{- x}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis statement is *true*. Therefore, the function $y=- 3 e^{- x}$ *is* a solution to our differential equation.\n\n- Differentiating $y=2 e^{- x},$ we get $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=- 2 e^{- x}.$ Substituting into the original equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =- y \\\\ - 2 e^{- x} & \\overset{?}{=}-1\\cdot \\left(2 e^{- x}\\right) \\\\ - 2 e^{- x} & =- 2 e^{- x}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis statement is *true*. Therefore, the function $y=2 e^{- x}$ *is* a solution to our differential equation.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $y=- 3 e^{- x}$; $y=2 e^{- x}$ only."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186494191 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2e5e6e5b-e827-559d-9b96-becf081b13fe" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494143} {:answer/id #uuid "371e1ab7-1e9f-540c-8961-08ec4f947f00" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494149}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "371e1ab7-1e9f-540c-8961-08ec4f947f00" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494149} :answer-field/id #uuid "7ea2a633-94d1-5a69-a720-9186d5b6eeae" :answer-field/key "$y=- x^{2} + 3 x$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494175} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "4bd5446e-a4cf-5b3c-82ce-514accb6955a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494161} {:answer/id #uuid "e160878b-1ed6-563f-9b98-b398745ccaea" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494214}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e160878b-1ed6-563f-9b98-b398745ccaea" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494214} :answer-field/id #uuid "a207163e-9b18-5847-88c5-ebf55d302e51" :answer-field/key "$y=- 3 x^{2} + 4 x$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494188} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "88d5258b-456f-5a33-a2dc-5f200f505556" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494180} {:answer/id #uuid "ce760cea-a8a9-5ce0-bc90-55ed5352aeb9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494207}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "ce760cea-a8a9-5ce0-bc90-55ed5352aeb9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494207} :answer-field/id #uuid "c6e8bc87-246a-5ed2-aedc-78f9176e6562" :answer-field/key "$y=2 x^{2} + 4 x$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494205}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "adc22bc0-1147-5a29-8060-cd0632ce97e9" :question/problem "Consider the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=-3 + \\frac{2 y}{x},\\,x\\ne 0.\n$$\n\n Which of the following is a solution to this equation?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "For a function $f(x)$ to be a solution to a differential equation, it must satisfy the equation for all values of $x$ in the stated domain.\n\nWe check each proposed solution by differentiating and substituting it into the original equation. \n\n- Differentiating $y=- x^{2} + 3 x,$ we get $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=3 - 2 x.$ Substituting into the original equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =-3 + \\frac{2 y}{x} \\\\ 3 - 2 x & \\overset{?}{=}\\frac{2\\cdot \\left(- x^{2} + 3 x\\right)}{x}-3 \\\\ 3 - 2 x & =3 - 2 x.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis statement is *true*. Therefore, the function $y=- x^{2} + 3 x$ *is* a solution to our differential equation.\n\n- Differentiating $y=- 3 x^{2} + 4 x,$ we get $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=4 - 6 x.$ Substituting into the original equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =-3 + \\frac{2 y}{x} \\\\ 4 - 6 x & \\overset{?}{=}\\frac{2\\cdot \\left(- 3 x^{2} + 4 x\\right)}{x}-3 \\\\ 4 - 6 x & \\overset{?}{=}5 - 6 x \\\\ -1 & \\not\\equiv 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis statement is *not true* for all $x.$ Therefore, the function $y=- 3 x^{2} + 4 x$ is *not* a solution to our differential equation.\n\n- Differentiating $y=2 x^{2} + 4 x,$ we get $\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=4 x + 4.$ Substituting into the original equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =-3 + \\frac{2 y}{x} \\\\ 4 x + 4 & \\overset{?}{=}\\frac{2\\cdot \\left(2 x^{2} + 4 x\\right)}{x}-3 \\\\ 4 x + 4 & \\overset{?}{=}4 x + 5 \\\\ -1 & \\not\\equiv 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis statement is *not true* for all $x.$ Therefore, the function $y=2 x^{2} + 4 x$ is *not* a solution to our differential equation.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $y=- x^{2} + 3 x$ only."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186494199 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3284c12a-285e-5b37-b1d3-d2b54e875d3b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494146} {:answer/id #uuid "d65aeea0-320d-5e02-9c26-f420ce319205" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494209}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "d65aeea0-320d-5e02-9c26-f420ce319205" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494209} :answer-field/id #uuid "1dad1ea5-f432-5bca-8f9b-610fc52026cb" :answer-field/key "$y=2 \\ln{\\left(x \\right)}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494139} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "61d8db18-1a08-588a-909e-dad6d5502ec0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494167} {:answer/id #uuid "e33d712a-5c46-537e-a67c-313162b8c8a9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494215}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "61d8db18-1a08-588a-909e-dad6d5502ec0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494167} :answer-field/id #uuid "31d1c65e-13db-53aa-a02c-2265851c694c" :answer-field/key "$y=1 - 2 \\ln{\\left(x \\right)}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494145} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a78be4a0-8c73-516f-970a-3c49bbd3d29d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494190} {:answer/id #uuid "bbf2ea96-a3e9-5044-91ff-48b24bff7f34" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494198}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a78be4a0-8c73-516f-970a-3c49bbd3d29d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494190} :answer-field/id #uuid "32f289b0-c3c5-521f-85b6-09ac6cef5f84" :answer-field/key "$y=\\ln{\\left(x \\right)}$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494147}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045486} :question/id #uuid "bc2cf9f7-3ebb-510f-a50d-009e8d3e2d2f" :question/problem "Consider the differential equation\n\n$$\n\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=2 e^{- \\frac{y}{2}},\\,x>0.\n$$\n\n Which of the following is a solution to this equation?\n\nSelect all that apply." :question/worked-solution "For a function $f(x)$ to be a solution to a differential equation, it must satisfy the equation for all values of $x$ in the stated domain.\n\nWe check each proposed solution by differentiating and substituting it into the original equation. \n\n- Differentiating $y=2 \\ln{\\left(x \\right)},$ we get $$\n\\displaystyle \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{2}{x}.\n$$ Substituting into the original equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =2 e^{- \\frac{y}{2}} \\\\ \\frac{2}{x} & \\overset{?}{=}2e^{-\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\left(2 \\ln{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)} \\\\ \\frac{2}{x} & \\overset{?}{=}2e^{0}\\cdot e^{\\ln\\left(\\frac{1}{x}\\right)} \\\\ \\frac{2}{x} & =\\frac{2}{x}.\\,✓\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis statement is *true*. Therefore, the function $y=2 \\ln{\\left(x \\right)}$ *is* a solution to our differential equation.\n\n- Differentiating $y=1 - 2 \\ln{\\left(x \\right)},$ we get $$\n\\displaystyle \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=- \\frac{2}{x}.\n$$ Substituting into the original equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =2 e^{- \\frac{y}{2}} \\\\ - \\frac{2}{x} & \\overset{?}{=}2e^{-\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\left(1 - 2 \\ln{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)} \\\\ - \\frac{2}{x} & \\overset{?}{=}2e^{- \\frac{1}{2}}\\cdot e^{\\ln\\left(x\\right)} \\\\ - \\frac{2}{x} & \\overset{?}{=}\\frac{2 x}{e^{\\frac{1}{2}}} \\\\ - \\frac{2 x}{e^{\\frac{1}{2}}} - \\frac{2}{x} & \\not\\equiv 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis statement is *not true* for all $x.$ Therefore, the function $y=1 - 2 \\ln{\\left(x \\right)}$ is *not* a solution to our differential equation.\n\n- Differentiating $y=\\ln{\\left(x \\right)},$ we get $$\n\\displaystyle \\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x}=\\frac{1}{x}.\n$$ Substituting into the original equation, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{\\text{d}y}{\\text{d}x} & =2 e^{- \\frac{y}{2}} \\\\ \\frac{1}{x} & \\overset{?}{=}2e^{-\\frac{1}{2}\\cdot \\left(\\ln{\\left(x \\right)}\\right)} \\\\ \\frac{1}{x} & \\overset{?}{=}2e^{0}\\cdot e^{\\ln\\left(\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{x}}\\right)} \\\\ \\frac{1}{x} & \\overset{?}{=}\\frac{2}{\\sqrt{x}} \\\\ \\frac{1}{x} - \\frac{2}{\\sqrt{x}} & \\not\\equiv 0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThis statement is *not true* for all $x.$ Therefore, the function $y=\\ln{\\left(x \\right)}$ is *not* a solution to our differential equation.\n\nTherefore, the correct answer is $y=2 \\ln{\\left(x \\right)}$ only."}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186494212 :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "2587e0fd-c2da-505a-bf9d-cc93290c0ee5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494142} {:answer/id #uuid "c0b343bc-0484-5d70-a0c5-1ddd2b18072d" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494202}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "2587e0fd-c2da-505a-bf9d-cc93290c0ee5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494142} :answer-field/id #uuid "1a713518-e004-530d-9096-230f529b44ea" :answer-field/key "$y=- 2 \\ln{\\left(x \\right)} - 1$" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186408166 :db/ident :answer-field.type/checkbox} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494137} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "096d33a3-6dda-5eca-9787-1267117dc021" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "true" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494130} {:answer/id #uuid "b852ee82-598a-5919-bab9-78ffe8c60820" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "false" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186494196}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b852ee82-598a-5919-bab9-78ffe8c60820" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.